{
  "version": 1,
  "mcpServers": {
    "basic-memory": {
      "targets": {
        "claude": true,
        "codex": false,
        "agy": true,
        "dsh": false,
        "opencode": true
      },
      "_note_codex": "codex 不支持 legacy SSE 传输（POST 得 405）；codex 侧改用本地 mcp-remote stdio 桥接，配置写在 ~/.codex/config.toml managed 区块外，详见该文件注释",
      "auto": true,
      "transport": "sse",
      "url": "https://vm-0-6-ubuntu.tailad41e7.ts.net/mcp"
    },
    "clawo": {
      "targets": {
        "claude": true,
        "codex": true,
        "agy": true,
        "dsh": false,
        "opencode": true
      },
      "auto": true,
      "transport": "stdio",
      "command": "clawo-mcp",
      "args": [],
      "env": {
        "HTTPS_PROXY": "${HTTPS_PROXY}",
        "HTTP_PROXY": "${HTTP_PROXY}",
        "https_proxy": "${https_proxy}",
        "http_proxy": "${http_proxy}",
        "NO_PROXY": "localhost,127.0.0.1,::1,192.168.0.0/16",
        "CLAWO_MCP_TOOLS": "session_start,session_send,session_stop,session_list,session_status,sessions_overview,coding_session_status,coding_agents_list,session_grep,session_compact"
      },
      "requires": {
        "bins": [
          "clawo-mcp"
        ],
        "npm": [
          "@enderfga/claw-orchestrator"
        ]
      }
    },
    "browser-use": {
      "targets": {
        "claude": true,
        "codex": true,
        "agy": true,
        "dsh": false,
        "opencode": true
      },
      "auto": true,
      "transport": "stdio",
      "command": "node",
      "args": [
        "${HUB_ROOT}/mcp/browser-use/server.mjs"
      ],
      "env": {
        "BROWSER_HEADLESS": "true"
      },
      "requires": {
        "bins": [
          "node"
        ]
      },
      "_note_deps": "① 依赖为【本地】安装于 ${HUB_ROOT}/mcp/browser-use/node_modules（在该目录 npm install）；不用 requires.npm —— 那是 npm -g CLI 的锁步字段。② playwright 已在 package.json 中 pin 为 1.62.0（上游写 ^1.50.0）：上游装到 1.63.0 需要 chromium_headless_shell-1243，而本机缓存只有 1234（python playwright 1.62.0 装的）；pin 到 1.62.0 后与 python 侧共用同一份 chromium，省去约 650MB 重复内核。③ BROWSER_HEADLESS=true 默认无头（上游 server.mjs 默认即无头）。④ server.mjs 的 Chrome 探测只认 macOS 路径，Linux 下自动回落到 Playwright 自带 chromium，无需改配置。"
    }
  }
}
